OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting measures welcomed by
OL,4,Atraders
OL,5,
OL,6,FShopkeepers in the West Midlands have
OL,7,Fwelcomed the announcement of new
OL,8,Fmeasures to cut shoplifting.
OL,10,FThe region is one of 16 police force
OL,11,Fareas chosen as part of a government
OL,12,Fpilot to target prolific retail
OL,13,Foffenders, which could see persistent
OL,14,Fthieves tagged and banned from high
OL,15,Fstreets.
OL,17,FMani Gill, vice-chair of the Soho Road
OL,18,FBusiness Improvement District (BID),
OL,19,FBirmingham, said shoplifting was a
OL,20,Fdaily occurrence, with small businesses
OL,21,Fleast able to absorb the costs.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
