OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting measures welcomed by
OL,4,Atraders
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Goss, lead for retail crime at the
OL,7,FNational Police Chief's Council, said
OL,8,Fhe welcomed the pilot to tackle
OL,9,Fprolific retail crime offenders "who
OL,10,Fcontinue to cause harm to businesses,
OL,11,Fretail workers and local communities".
